* Replace cascode gate bias with common-gate stage for lower input impedance
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n3 VSS
L L2 n3 VSS
NMOS NM2 n2 VDD n4 VSS  ; Original cascode swapped
NMOS NM4 n0 VDD VIN1 VSS  ; Common-gate stage at input
L L3 VDD n4
C C2 n4 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1